  "solution": "The logic followed here is:\n\nI. 9 → 3 = 32\n\n⇒ __**(9 × 3)**__ + 5 = 32\n\n⇒ __**27 + 5**__ = 32\n\n⇒ 32 = 32 (LHS = RHS)\n\nII. 6 → 7 = 47\n\n⇒ __(6 × 7)__ + 5 = 47\n\n⇒ __42 + 5__ = 47\n\n⇒ 47 = 47 (LHS = RHS)\n\nIII. 13 → 3 = 44\n\n⇒ __(13 × 3)__ + 5 = 44\n\n⇒ __**39** + 5__ = 44\n\n⇒ 44 = 44 (LHS = RHS)\n\nSimilarly,\n\nIV. 12 → 3 = ?\n\n⇒ __(12 × 3)__ + 5 = ?\n\n⇒ __36 + 5__ = ?\n\n⇒ **41 = ?**\n\nHence, \"Option 4\" is the correct answer.",
